"body":"## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nSince the shortcut keys for editor main screen plugins use the plugin name, the lookup to show the tooltip for the Asset Store button was failing; instead of \"asset store\" it was expecting \"assetlib\". Per discussion in the contributors chat, the fix for now is just to rename the shortcut key.\r\n\r\nValidated that the tooltip now shows (and that remapping still works). Also added a unit test with a minimal plugin for avoiding any future regressions.\r\n\r\n- Closes #120557\r\n\r\n## Screenshot\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1917\" height=\"1029\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/aadcc5e1-d761-430b-a2b6-addc7c9f3a54\" />\r\n","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":283518733,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyODM1MTg3MzM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/usability","name":"usability","description":"","color":"447744","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":{"id":15520464,"node_id":"MI_kwDOAO6SJc4A7NLQ","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/milestone/25","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/milestones/25/labels","number":25,"state":"open","title":"4.8","description":"","creator":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers